  "description": "Style native MAUI controls with the Tailwind class vocabulary: tw:Tw.Class in XAML, .Tw(\"...\") in C#. Includes a Roslyn analyzer that validates class strings at build time and a source generator that precompiles literal classes into cached style plans, so applying a class at runtime is a dictionary hit rather than a parse. Namespace: Tw.Maui.",
